---
const routes = Object.keys(import.meta.glob('./**/*.astro')).length;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head
    ><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta
      name="robots"
      content="noindex,nofollow"
    /><title>About this unofficial Mysa prototype</title></head
  ><body
    ><main>
      <p>Independent engineering study</p><h1>A faithful frontend, with less browser work.</h1><p>
        This is an unofficial internship portfolio project. Mysa’s brand, content and assets belong
        to their respective owners. This prototype is not operated by Mysa.
      </p><p>
        The Astro build recreates the current marketing pages. Booking forms validate locally; no
        information is sent and no appointments are booked. Login and external resources lead to the
        official services.
      </p><h2>What changed</h2><ul>
        <li>Static Astro components replace the Webflow client runtime.</li><li>
          Dot artwork uses external images and pointer-driven canvas instead of thousands of live
          SVG circles.
        </li><li>Videos load only when visible at the active breakpoint.</li><li>
          Fonts and artwork are served locally; production tracking is omitted.
        </li>
      </ul><p>
        Read the repository’s case study and raw reports for measured results and limitations.
        Performance targets are not a guarantee.
      </p><p>{routes} source routes. <a href="/">Open the prototype →</a></p>
    </main></body>
</html>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f5faf8;
    color: #173a34;
    font: 18px/1.65 system-ui;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 80px auto;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
  }
  h2 {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
  a {
    color: #006b5e;
  }
</style>
